s transitions, physical speakers, musical fidelity, save persistence and mouse aiming.\\\\n- Full capstone items are not established: real autonomous repair, live resumption, accountability, design rationale and reflection.\\\\n- The teammate exercise is NOT PERFORMED, as the user requested.\\\\n\\\\nThis is a scoped automated PASS, not full assignment completion.\\\",\\n5:   \\\"source_digest\\\": \\\"6ef3e2af1bf51ab5ffc051b67b311a2a3e889da805d322913d19fe02deb9af12\\\"\\n6: }\"}"}], "isError": false}}
